WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.218 --> 00:00:03.922
打开Agent面板 / Open the Agent panel

2
00:00:03.922 --> 00:00:07.127
新建需要保留的Chat / Create the Chat to retain

3
00:00:07.127 --> 00:00:10.674
命名Guide retained chat / Name it Guide retained chat

4
00:00:10.674 --> 00:00:13.749
输入本轮公开问题 / Enter this run’s public prompt

5
00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:17.443
用Command+Enter发送 / Send with Command+Enter

6
00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:20.744
通过真实Tab导航读取Context / Use actual Tab navigation to read Context

7
00:00:20.744 --> 00:00:23.874
离开Context焦点 / Move focus away from Context

8
00:00:23.874 --> 00:00:27.014
参考用量后新建独立Chat / Start a separate Chat after reviewing usage

9
00:00:27.014 --> 00:00:30.489
命名Guide fresh context / Name it Guide fresh context

10
00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:34.079
再建运行中删除示例 / Create the running-deletion example

11
00:00:34.079 --> 00:00:37.802
发起保持流式响应的本地演示 / Start the local held-stream example

12
00:00:37.802 --> 00:00:41.118
运行中打开删除确认 / Open deletion confirmation while running

13
00:00:41.118 --> 00:00:44.464
确认删除并取消这条流 / Confirm deletion and cancel that stream

14
00:00:44.464 --> 00:00:47.607
回到保留的Chat / Return to the retained Chat

15
00:00:47.607 --> 00:00:50.648
确认持久内容后正常关闭 / Confirm persistent content before normal Close
